<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $44-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $44-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADS opened $0-1/2 higher at $44-5/8 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 203.68 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
